msgstr "Выбраны:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configHolidays.qml:180
#: win/host/settings/CalendarHolidays.qml:125
msgctxt "@action:button drop a holiday region"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Убрать"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configHolidays.qml:193
#: win/host/settings/CalendarHolidays.qml:134
msgid ""
"none — your locale's own region. Once you tick one, only the ticked ones "
"count: tick yours too."
msgstr ""
"ничего — регион вашей локали. Как только отметите один, считаются только "
"отмеченные: отметьте и свой."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configHolidays.qml:201
msgid ""
"Tick as many as you like. The choice is shared with the calendar of Plasma's "
"clock and saved at once."
msgstr ""
"Отмечайте сколько угодно. Выбор общий с календарём часов Plasma и "
"сохраняется сразу."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configHolidays.qml:257
#: win/host/settings/CalendarHolidays.qml:194
msgid "Nothing found"
msgstr "Ничего не найдено"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:19
#: win/host/settings/MousePage.qml:15
msgid "Mouse:"
msgstr "Мышь:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:20
#: win/host/settings/MousePage.qml:16
msgid "let clicks through to the desktop"
msgstr "пропускать клики на рабочий стол"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:24
msgid ""
"While clicks go through, both mouse buttons land on the desktop.\n"
"The widget takes the mouse only in the desktop's edit mode:\n"
"that is where its settings are, or ./install.sh with the clicks off switch."
msgstr ""
"Пока клики проходят насквозь, обе кнопки мыши попадают на рабочий стол.\n"
"Виджет берёт мышь только в режиме правки рабочего стола:\n"
"там же его настройки, либо ./install.sh с ключом clicks off."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:57
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:25
msgctxt "the account of the widget's own notes: a folder of files"
msgid "local — this machine"
msgstr "локально — на этой машине"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:93
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:58
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Заметки"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:97
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:61
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "Заметки:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:98
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:62
msgid "mark the days that have entries, open a sticker on click"
msgstr "отмечать дни с записями, по клику открывать стикер"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:102
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:65
msgid ""
"A click on a day opens its sticker: the day's events and tasks from the "
"accounts,\n"
"and a note of yours — the first line is its title. Off, the calendar is the "
"plain grid\n"
"and takes no clicks at all."
msgstr ""
"Клик по дню открывает его стикер: события и задачи дня из аккаунтов\n"
"и ваша заметка — первая строка её заголовок. Выключено — календарь просто "
"сетка\n"
"и кликов не принимает."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:109
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:68
msgid "Write notes to:"
msgstr "Писать заметки в:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:117
msgid ""
"“local” keeps them as .ics files in ~/.local/share/plaincalendar/notes;\n"
"an account from the Accounts page sends them to that calendar as all-day "
"events."
msgstr ""
"«локально» хранит их файлами .ics в ~/.local/share/plaincalendar/notes;\n"
"аккаунт со страницы «Аккаунты» отправляет их в тот календарь событиями на "
"весь день."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:124
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:81
msgid "Upcoming lines:"
msgstr "Строк «ближайшее»:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:131
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:85
msgid "The next entries, one per line under the months; 0 hides them."
msgstr "Ближайшие записи, по строке под месяцами; 0 скрывает их."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:138
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:87
msgid "Fetch the accounts every, min:"
msgstr "Опрашивать аккаунты каждые, мин:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:144
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:92
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Reminders"
msgstr "Напоминания"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:148
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:95
msgid "Reminders:"
msgstr "Напоминания:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:150
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:97
msgid "a sheet by the day's cell when an entry is due"
msgstr "лист у ячейки дня, когда подходит срок записи"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:154
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:100
msgid ""
"A note whose first line starts with a time — “14:30 Dentist” — becomes a "
"timed\n"
"entry and rings before it; “!Buy milk” stays a note and rings at the hour "
"below.\n"
"The accounts' events ring by their own alarms. Both reach the phone through "
"the\n"
"account. The sheet offers to snooze, to put it off till tomorrow, or done."
msgstr ""
"Заметка, первая строка которой начинается со времени — «14:30 Стоматолог», — "
"становится\n"
"записью со временем и звонит перед ним; «!Купить молоко» остаётся заметкой и "
"звонит в час,\n"
"указанный ниже. События аккаунтов звонят своими будильниками. И то, и другое "
"доходит до\n"
"телефона через аккаунт. Лист предлагает отложить, перенести на завтра или "
"«готово»."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:161
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:103
msgid "Before a timed entry, min:"
msgstr "До записи со временем, мин:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:165
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:109
msgctxt "no reminder before timed notes"
msgid "none"
msgstr "нет"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:171
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:114
msgid "“!” notes ring at:"
msgstr "Заметки с «!» звонят в:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:180
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:119
msgid "Events without an alarm:"
msgstr "События без будильника:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:182
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:121
msgid "ring before them too, as for a timed note"
msgstr "звонить и перед ними, как перед заметкой со временем"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:187
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:124
msgid "Snooze for, min:"
msgstr "Отложить на, мин:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:195
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:129
msgid "Show missed ones from the last, h:"
msgstr "Показывать пропущенные за последние, ч:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:202
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:133
msgid "While the machine was off: alarms older than this are dropped quietly."
msgstr "Пока машина была выключена: будильники старше этого тихо пропускаются."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:209
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:135
msgid "System notification:"
msgstr "Системное уведомление:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:211
msgid ""
"also through notify-send — in Plasma's history, silenced by Do Not Disturb"
msgstr ""
"ещё и через notify-send — в истории Plasma, молчит в режиме «Не беспокоить»"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:215
#: win/host/settings/CalendarNotes.qml:143
